  "title": "Mother&#39;s Pot Roast",
  "description": "Easy pot roast made from shoulder or sirloin tip roast, prepared in a slow cooker with onion and tomato. Serve with mashed potatoes to soak up the sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "J Stewart"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-10-07T14:41:01-04:00",
